{"id":"if-i-could-keep-one-moment","v":1,"lines":[{"t0":13.1,"t1":18.08,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"The coffee's cold, the room is still,","w":[[13.1,13.58],[13.58,14.66],[14.66,15.32],[15.32,15.52],[15.52,15.94],[15.94,16.3],[16.3,16.88]]},{"t0":20.14,"t1":25.04,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"The morning light climbs up the hill.","w":[[20.14,20.62],[20.62,21.04],[21.04,21.52],[21.52,22.08],[22.08,22.6],[22.6,22.96],[22.96,23.84]]},{"t0":26.76,"t1":31.14,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"You tell a story I've heard before,","w":[[26.76,27.24],[27.24,27.64],[27.64,27.8],[27.8,28.3],[28.3,28.94],[28.94,29.26],[29.26,29.94]]},{"t0":31.94,"t1":38.24,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"I laugh like I never heard it at all.","w":[[31.94,32.18],[32.18,32.6],[32.6,33.02],[33.02,33.62],[33.62,34.3],[34.3,35.24],[35.24,35.74],[35.74,36.16],[36.16,37.04]]},{"t0":40.2,"t1":45.28,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"The little things we never see,","w":[[40.2,40.68],[40.68,41],[41,41.5],[41.5,42.1],[42.1,42.66],[42.66,44.08]]},{"t0":45.76,"t1":52,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"Are the things that mean the most to me.","w":[[45.76,46.24],[46.24,46.36],[46.36,46.74],[46.74,47.06],[47.06,47.46],[47.46,47.92],[47.92,49.14],[49.14,49.56],[49.56,50.94]]},{"t0":52,"t1":56.82,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"A hand to hold, a familiar face,","w":[[52,52.24],[52.24,52.72],[52.72,52.92],[52.92,53.82],[53.82,55.4],[55.4,56.04],[56.04,56.8]]},{"t0":56.82,"t1":63.88,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"A quiet heart in a crowded place.","w":[[56.82,57.06],[57.06,59.14],[59.14,59.96],[59.96,61.3],[61.3,61.44],[61.44,62.42],[62.42,63.86]]},{"t0":63.88,"t1":69.46,"sec":"Chorus","text":"If I could keep one moment in a jar,","w":[[63.88,64.64],[64.64,65.18],[65.18,65.4],[65.4,65.76],[65.76,66.25],[66.25,67.12],[67.12,67.62],[67.62,67.84],[67.84,68.26]]},{"t0":70.98,"t1":76.98,"sec":"Chorus","text":"I'd keep this room, just as we are.","w":[[70.98,71.46],[71.46,71.76],[71.76,72.38],[72.38,73.18],[73.18,73.84],[73.84,74.48],[74.48,74.74],[74.74,75.78]]},{"t0":77.72,"t1":81.46,"sec":"Chorus","text":"No grand goodbye, no last embrace,","w":[[77.72,78.08],[78.08,78.69],[78.69,79.5],[79.5,79.8],[79.8,80.52],[80.52,81.44]]},{"t0":81.46,"t1":89.04,"sec":"Chorus","text":"Just your laughter filling up this place.","w":[[81.46,83.42],[83.42,84.02],[84.02,85.1],[85.1,86.06],[86.06,86.6],[86.6,87.12],[87.12,87.84]]},{"t0":90.48,"t1":95.56,"sec":"Chorus","text":"And when the years have carried us away,","w":[[90.48,90.96],[90.96,91.3],[91.3,92.14],[92.14,92.86],[92.86,93.08],[93.08,93.78],[93.78,94.3],[94.3,94.9]]},{"t0":95.56,"t1":102.66,"sec":"Chorus","text":"I'd open it on a rainy day.","w":[[95.56,96.26],[96.26,96.88],[96.88,97.46],[97.46,97.82],[97.82,98.06],[98.06,98.96],[98.96,101.46]]},{"t0":102.94,"t1":111.38,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"The pictures fade, the children grow,","w":[[102.94,104.22],[104.22,107.88],[107.88,108.47],[108.47,108.94],[108.94,109.54],[109.54,110.18]]},{"t0":112.28,"t1":118.84,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"There are so many things we cannot know.","w":[[112.28,113],[113,113.26],[113.26,113.76],[113.76,114.54],[114.54,115.3],[115.3,115.8],[115.8,116.34],[116.34,117.64]]},{"t0":120.58,"t1":125.38,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"But every wrinkle, every line,","w":[[120.58,121.06],[121.06,121.5],[121.5,122.98],[122.98,123.28],[123.28,124.18]]},{"t0":126.36,"t1":132.26,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"Is proof that you were here with mine.","w":[[126.36,126.72],[126.72,127.1],[127.1,127.5],[127.5,127.84],[127.84,128.18],[128.18,128.64],[128.64,129.68],[129.68,131.06]]},{"t0":133.88,"t1":137.86,"sec":"Bridge","text":"We spend our lives chasing the sun,","w":[[133.88,134.24],[134.24,134.62],[134.62,135],[135,135.78],[135.78,136.44],[136.44,136.8],[136.8,137.84]]},{"t0":137.86,"t1":144.79,"sec":"Bridge","text":"Forgetting the gold in the days we've won.","w":[[137.86,140.8],[140.8,140.92],[140.92,141.4],[141.4,141.84],[141.84,141.94],[141.94,142.46],[142.46,143.34],[143.34,143.59]]},{"t0":145.92,"t1":151.56,"sec":"Bridge","text":"If there's one thing I could make you see,","w":[[145.92,146.28],[146.28,146.98],[146.98,147.32],[147.32,147.8],[147.8,149.14],[149.14,149.4],[149.4,149.8],[149.8,150.6],[150.6,151.54]]},{"t0":151.56,"t1":158.08,"sec":"Bridge","text":"It's that this moment is enough for me.","w":[[151.56,152.16],[152.16,153.06],[153.06,153.52],[153.52,154.14],[154.14,155.28],[155.28,156],[156,156.92],[156.92,158.06]]},{"t0":158.08,"t1":163.54,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"If I could keep one moment in a jar,","w":[[158.08,158.94],[158.94,159.22],[159.22,159.44],[159.44,159.78],[159.78,160.2],[160.2,161.16],[161.16,161.76],[161.76,161.88],[161.88,162.34]]},{"t0":165.16,"t1":170.78,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"I'd keep this room, just as we are.","w":[[165.16,165.64],[165.64,165.84],[165.84,166.58],[166.58,167.2],[167.2,167.96],[167.96,168.58],[168.58,168.84],[168.84,169.58]]},{"t0":171.52,"t1":176.08,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"And if tomorrow changes everything,","w":[[171.52,172],[172,172.18],[172.18,172.7],[172.7,173.64],[173.64,174.88]]},{"t0":177.26,"t1":183.22,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"I'd still have this little song to sing.","w":[[177.26,177.74],[177.74,178.14],[178.14,178.62],[178.62,179.18],[179.18,179.62],[179.62,180.46],[180.46,181.22],[181.22,182.02]]}],"gloss":[{"w":"If I could … I'd …","m":{"en":"imagining something that is not real now (second conditional)","tr":"Eğer …-ebilseydim, …-ardım","fa":"اگه می‌تونستم…، … می‌کردم","es":"Si pudiera…, …-ría"},"at":[[8,"If I could"],[9,"I'd"],[13,"I'd"],[22,"If I could"],[23,"I'd"],[25,"I'd"]]},{"w":"jar","m":{"en":"a glass container with a lid","tr":"kavanoz","fa":"شیشه (ظرف شیشه‌ای دَردار)","es":"frasco, tarro"},"at":[[8,"jar"],[22,"jar"]]},{"w":"familiar","m":{"en":"that you know well because you have seen it many times","tr":"tanıdık","fa":"آشنا","es":"familiar, conocido"},"at":[[6,"familiar"]]},{"w":"laughter","m":{"en":"the sound of people laughing","tr":"kahkaha, gülüş","fa":"خنده","es":"risa"},"at":[[11,"laughter"]]},{"w":"proof","m":{"en":"something that shows that a thing is true","tr":"kanıt","fa":"مدرک، نشونه","es":"prueba"},"at":[[17,"proof"]]},{"w":"enough","m":{"en":"as much as you need","tr":"yeterli","fa":"کافی","es":"suficiente"},"at":[[21,"enough"]]}]}